e.png", "id": "2089174581980110", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620669_2089174585313443_7767095439357325750_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=siQP-5J-YeIQ7kNvwHydEQn&_nc_oc=AdpaF3YG25hbfdeWrxmst3LnazN3n-swZtYJS9nE2NYcftgsOg5lIqMNIhslHIc879U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTewGrzsvo6ibCDBqsfdjRVEG1aGRXnCUF9-XTufJqdwA&oe=6AEA113C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Mythy Vision", "keywords": ["mythology", "folklore", "legends", "fairytales", "education"], "long_description": "Mythy Vision is an atlas of the world's stories. Every point on the globe is a tale, placed where it was first told: 2,702 myths, legends, folktales and fairy tales from 169 countries, each with a short retelling, its source and its original name.\n\nDiscover how stories travel\nOpen any story and its closest relatives light up, joined by arcs across the planet. Flood myths from Mesopotamia, India, Greece and the Andes. Creation from the body of a giant, from China to Iceland. Tricksters, swan maidens, journeys to the underworld - the same ideas, told again and again.\n\nExplore your way\n- Filter by 20 motifs: Sun, Moon, Flood, Fire, Dragon, Love, Hero, Trickster, Underworld and more\n- Travel through four eras, from undatable creation myths to tales collected in recent centuries\n- Open a country to browse everything told there, with artwork for hundreds of stories\n- Switch the globe between Terrain, Satellite and Dots\n- Listen to any story read aloud\n\nMade for VR\nHold the planet at arm's length and spin it with the thumbstick. Point at a story and pull the trigger to open it. Everything works with one controller and there is no movement, so it is comfortable seated or standing.\n\nAbout the stories\nRetellings are short AI-assisted summaries of well-known sources - Wikipedia, Ovid, the Brothers Grimm, the Mahabharata, the Kojiki, One Thousand and One Nights - and simplify the originals. Artwork is freely licensed, from Wikimedia Commons.", "short_description": "Spin a glowing globe and open 2,702 myths, legends, folktales and fairy tales from 169 countries. Pick a story to see the tales that echo it across the world: Noah's Ark beside Manu's flood, Pangu beside Ymir, dragon-slayers from Babylon to Kyiv. Filter by 20 motifs and four eras, listen to any story read aloud, and step into VR to turn the whole planet in your hands."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mythy.modee.top/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jiehua", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mythy.modee.top/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1312380885302890"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1629754568733591"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1629754568733591"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1791287880, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1629754568733591"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1339140022626976", "version": "6"}, "id": "1075791458587059", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__i